# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# The library is a client-routed app, so a cold request for a deep link —
# /book/<slug>, /admin, /settings, or the installed app's start_url after a
# cache miss — has no file of its own on the host. Rewriting to index.html
# (200, not a redirect) lets the router resolve the path in the browser and
# keeps the URL intact. Static files still win: this only applies when nothing
# else matches.
/*    /index.html   200
